# Two real 6.03r7 clients. The probe client (logged in last, left window) is moved by its own X/Y props,
# so the other client (right window) should draw it apart from itself; then a fake player id 7 is sent
# to the probe client with the exact props the server sent it about the real other player.
waitsession 300
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 15
shot 00-both
s2c 9 c:15 c:40 c:16 c:40
sleep 6
shot 01-probe-moved-to-20-20
# {FAKE} = 2-byte player id 7 + the body of otherpl-fullprops.txt + X 50, Y 40
s2c 8 {FAKE}
sleep 6
shot 02-fake-player-7
